### Регистрация
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test2@mail.ru",
  "password": "123456",
  "name": "Александр"
}

### Вход
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@mail.ru",
  "password": "123456"
}

### Профиль
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/profile/hFUQ15KnxZ4zKtG5

### Генерация рассказа (Эрмитаж, стиль Историк)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/generations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "placeId": "place_001",
  "style": "HISTORIAN",
  "language": "ru"
}

